ton County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair got 31% of normal, and July to August got 47%. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 36% and June to July at 156%.</p>"}
